  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "そぼうで　みがってな　せいかく。\nきぶんが　のらなければ　トレーナーの\nめいれいも　へいきで　むしするぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "거칠고 제멋대로인 성격이다.\n기분이 내키지 않으면 트레이너의\n명령도 아무렇지 않게 무시한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性格粗魯又任性。\n心情不爽的時候，連訓練家的\n命令也會冷漠地無視。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon brutal qui n’en fait qu’à sa tête.\nSelon son humeur du moment, il lui arrive\nd’ignorer sciemment les ordres de son Dresseur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein raues und selbstsüchtiges Pokémon.\nWenn es keine Lust hat, ignoriert es auch\nschon mal die Befehle seines Trainers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee un carácter rudo y egoísta. Si un\nEntrenador no le cae en gracia, ignora sus\nórdenes con total impasibilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un carattere aggressivo ed egoista.\nSe ha la luna storta, non si fa problemi\na ignorare gli ordini del proprio Allenatore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon has a violent, selfish disposition.\nIf it’s not in the mood to listen, it will ignore its\nTrainer’s orders with complete nonchalance.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "粗暴で　身勝手な　性格。\n気分が　乗らなければ　トレーナーの\n命令も　平気で　無視するぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性格粗鲁又任性。\n心情不爽的时候，连训练家的\n命令也会淡定地无视。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee un carácter rudo y egoísta. Si un\nEntrenador no le cae en gracia, ignora sus\nórdenes con total impasibilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きょうれつな　パンチや　キックを\nおみまいしたあと　へその　あたりから\nほのおを　ふきだし　とどめを　さす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강렬한 펀치와 킥을\n가한 후 배꼽 부근에서\n불꽃을 뿜어내 마무리한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在使出猛烈的拳擊或腳踢後，\n會從肚臍周圍噴出火焰，\n將敵人一擊斃命。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Après avoir asséné une pluie de coups de pied\net de poing à son adversaire, il l’asperge de\nflammes ardentes sortant de son nombril.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nach einer Reihe heftiger Schläge und Tritte\nschießt es Feuer aus seinem Bauchnabel,\num dem Gegner den Garaus zu machen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Descarga ráfagas de demoledores puñetazos y\npatadas sobre sus rivales, a los que luego\nremata con las llamas que manan de su vientre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Stordisce il nemico con pugni e calci di grande\npotenza per poi metterlo KO con le fiammate\nche emette dal ventre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "After hurling ferocious punches and flinging\nfurious kicks, it finishes opponents off by\nspewing fire from around its navel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "強烈な　パンチや　キックを\nお見舞いしたあと　へその　あたりから\n炎を　吹き出し　止めを　刺す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在使出猛烈的拳击或脚踢后，\n会从肚脐周围喷出火焰，\n将敌人一击毙命。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Descarga ráfagas de demoledores puñetazos y\npatadas sobre sus rivales, a los que luego\nremata con las llamas que manan de su vientre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あらっぽく　わがままだが　かくしたを\nなぶることは　つまらないので　キライ。\nかくうえの　あいてに　やるきを　だす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "거칠고 제멋대로지만 약한 상대를\n괴롭히는 것은 재미없어서 싫어한다.\n강한 상대에게 의욕을 보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "個性粗魯又任性，但討厭欺負弱小\n這種無聊的事，只有在面對\n強大對手時才會拿出幹勁。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon brutal qui n’en fait qu’à sa tête.\nSelon son humeur du moment, il lui arrive parfois\nd’ignorer sciemment les ordres de son Dresseur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist wild und egoistisch, aber Schwächere\nanzugreifen findet es langweilig und abstoßend.\nNur gegen Stärkere kommt es richtig in Fahrt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon rudo y egoísta considera aburrido\nenfrentarse a un rival inferior a él y prefiere dar\nlo mejor de sí mismo contra rivales más fuertes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
